      "text": "Comment from someone knowledgeable I met last night:\n\nThe people at Blue Origin are more talented, but SpaceX has a much better culture.\n\nIt does not surprise him that SpaceX is doing much better than Blue Origin.\n\nCulture &gt;&gt; Talent, especially in the limit",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1203912829746573312"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2019-12-08T17:46:08.000Z",
