        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 990,
        "quote_count": 19,
        "reply_count": 15,
        "retweet_count": 114
      },
      "text": "The reason to work at a successful startup before starting your own is to have a really good initialization.\n\nMost startups are broken in many ways, but are incredibly effective at the most significant bits.\n\nIt pays to be imprinted with a winning culture.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1203732505498509312"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2019-12-07T20:24:16.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1203409913763921920"
      ],
      "id": "1203409913763921920",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 10,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 105,
        "quote_count": 1,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 21
      },
      "text": "There's storytelling and there's science.\n\nStorytelling is more effective in matters with people. Science is more effective in matters with systems.\n\nScience is how you can create long term value.\n\nStorytelling is how you can produce short term value (a spark to jumpstart it).",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1203409913763921920"
    },
