        "quote_count": 2,
        "reply_count": 3,
        "retweet_count": 23
      },
      "text": "Key management skill #106:\n\nSeparate the message from the delivery.\n\nThere is almost always an important message in what someone is telling you, regardless of how they choose to deliver it.\n\nBeing able to identify signal from every conversation is at the core of great leadership.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1202341328769568768"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2019-12-04T04:08:27.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1202077178701025280"
      ],
      "id": "1202077178701025280",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 7,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 170,
        "quote_count": 3,
        "reply_count": 4,
        "retweet_count": 9
      },
      "text": "If a candidate is about to turn you down, do NOT go for broke by discrediting the other company and saying they're being stupid.\n\n1. Careers are long, so it's very likely you will cross paths in the future.\n2. Respect their decision. They are smart.\n\nDon't be short-sighted.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1202077178701025280"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2019-12-02T02:22:57.000Z",
