        "like_count": 293,
        "quote_count": 3,
        "reply_count": 4,
        "retweet_count": 49
      },
      "text": "The secret to accomplishing impressive things:\n\nDo not give yourself a way out.\n\nEither you do it, or you don't and you should keep working at it. It is tempting to give yourself excuses (\"I didn't have resources\", \"I learned a lot\", etc).\n\nBut that's not how these things happen.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1201325852606119937"
    },
